# BOOK	002	EXO	Exodus	Exodus
002	EXO	001	001	These are the names of the sons of Israel, who went into Egypt with Jacob. They entered, each one with his house:
002	EXO	001	002	Reuben, Simeon, Levi, Judah,
002	EXO	001	003	Issachar, Zebulun, and Benjamin,
002	EXO	001	004	Dan and Naphtali, Gad and Asher.
