003	LEV	014	028	And he shall touch the tip of the right ear of him who is being cleansed, and the thumb of his right hand, as well as the foot, in the place of the blood which was shed for transgression.
003	LEV	014	029	But the remaining part of the oil which is in his left hand, he shall send upon the head of the one being purified, to appease the Lord on his behalf.
003	LEV	014	030	And he shall offer a turtledove or a young pigeon,
003	LEV	014	031	one for transgression, and the other as a holocaust, with their libations.
