003	LEV	014	033	And the Lord spoke to Moses and Aaron, saying:
003	LEV	014	034	When you will have entered into the land of Canaan, which I will give to you as a possession, if there is the mark of leprosy in a building,
003	LEV	014	035	he whose house it is shall go and report to the priest, saying: “It seems to me that the mark of leprosy is in my house.”
003	LEV	014	036	And he shall instruct them to carry all things out of the house, before he would enter it and see whether it is leprosy, lest all that is in the house become unclean. And after this, he shall enter to examine the leprosy of the house.
003	LEV	014	037	And when he will have seen in its walls something like little hollows, deformed with paleness or redness, and lower than the remaining surface,
003	LEV	014	038	he shall exit by the door of the house, and immediately close it up for seven days.
003	LEV	014	039	And returning on the seventh day, he shall examine it. If he finds that the leprosy has spread,
