003	LEV	014	049	And for its purification, he shall take two sparrows, and cedar wood, and vermillion, as well as hyssop,
003	LEV	014	050	and, having immolated one sparrow in an earthen vessel over living waters,
003	LEV	014	051	he shall take the cedar wood, and the hyssop, and the scarlet, and the living sparrow, and he shall dip all these in the blood of the immolated sparrow, and also in the living water, and he shall sprinkle the house seven times.
