003	LEV	018	001	And the Lord spoke to Moses, saying:
003	LEV	018	002	Speak to the sons of Israel, and you shall say to them: I am the Lord your God.
003	LEV	018	003	You shall not act according to the custom of the land of Egypt, in which you have lived; nor shall you behave according to the habit of the region of Canaan, into which I will lead you; neither shall you walk in their ordinances.
003	LEV	018	004	You shall accomplish my judgments, and you shall observe my precepts, and you shall walk in them. I am the Lord your God.
003	LEV	018	005	Keep my laws and judgments; when a man does these, he shall live by them. I am the Lord.
003	LEV	018	006	No man shall approach her who is a close blood-relative to him, so as to uncover her nakedness. I am the Lord.
003	LEV	018	007	You shall not expose the nakedness of your father, or the nakedness of your mother. She is your mother; you shall not uncover her nakedness.
003	LEV	018	008	You shall not expose the nakedness of your father’s wife; for it is the nakedness of your father.
003	LEV	018	009	You shall not uncover the nakedness of your sister, whether from father or from mother, whether she was born at home or abroad.
003	LEV	018	010	You shall not uncover the nakedness of your son’s daughter, or your daughter’s daughter; for it is your own nakedness.
003	LEV	018	011	You shall not uncover the nakedness of your father’s wife’s daughter, whom she bore to your father, and who is your sister.
003	LEV	018	012	You shall not expose the nakedness of your father’s sister; for she is the flesh of your father.
003	LEV	018	013	You shall not uncover the nakedness of your mother’s sister, because she is the flesh of your mother.
003	LEV	018	014	You shall not uncover the nakedness of your father’s brother, nor shall you approach his wife, who is joined to you by affinity.
003	LEV	018	015	You shall not uncover the nakedness of your daughter-in-law, for she is your son’s wife; neither shall you expose her dishonor.
003	LEV	018	016	You shall not uncover the nakedness of your brother’s wife; for it is the nakedness of your brother.
003	LEV	018	017	You shall not uncover the nakedness of your wife and her daughter. You shall not take her son’s daughter or her daughter’s daughter, so as to uncover her dishonor; for they are her flesh, and such sexual intercourse is incest.
003	LEV	018	018	You shall not take your wife’s sister as a rival mistress; nor shall you uncover her nakedness, while your wife is still living.
003	LEV	018	019	You shall not approach a woman who is undergoing menstruation, nor shall you uncover her foulness.
003	LEV	018	020	You shall not have sexual intercourse with your neighbor’s wife, nor shall you be defiled by the mingling of seed.
003	LEV	018	021	You shall not give some of your seed to be consecrated to the idol Moloch, nor to pollute the name of your God. I am the Lord.
003	LEV	018	022	You shall not commit sexual acts with a male, in place of sexual intercourse with a female, for this is an abomination.
003	LEV	018	023	You shall not commit sexual acts with any animal, nor shall you be defiled by it. A woman shall not lie down with a beast, nor commit sexual acts with it; for this is wickedness.
003	LEV	018	024	Do not pollute yourselves with any of these things, by which all of the nations, which I will cast out in your sight, have been contaminated
003	LEV	018	025	and by which the land has been polluted. I will visit the wickedness of the land, so that it may vomit out its inhabitants.
003	LEV	018	026	Keep my ordinances and judgments, and do not do any of these abominations: the native born, as well as the settler, who sojourns among you.
003	LEV	018	027	For all these detestable things were done by the inhabitants of the land who were here before you, and they have polluted it.
003	LEV	018	028	Therefore, beware, lest in a similar manner, it may vomit you out as well, if you do these same things, just as it vomited out the people who were before you.
003	LEV	018	029	Every soul who shall commit any of these abominations shall perish from the midst of his people.
003	LEV	018	030	Keep my commandments. Do not be willing to do the things which have been done by those who were before you, and do not be polluted by these things. I am the Lord your God.
003	LEV	019	001	The Lord spoke to Moses, saying:
003	LEV	019	002	Speak to the entire assembly of the sons of Israel, and you shall say to them: Be holy, for I, the Lord your God, am holy.
003	LEV	019	003	Let each one fear his father and his mother. Observe my Sabbaths. I am the Lord your God.
003	LEV	019	004	Do not be willing to convert to idols, neither should you make molten gods for yourselves. I am the Lord your God.
003	LEV	019	005	If you immolate a victim of peace offerings to the Lord, so that he may be appeased,
003	LEV	019	006	you shall eat it on the same day as when it was immolated, and the next day. Then whatever will remain on the third day you shall burn with fire.
