003	LEV	019	024	But in the fourth year, all their fruit shall be sanctified for the praise of the Lord.
003	LEV	019	025	And in the fifth year you shall eat the produce, gathering the fruits which are brought forth. I am the Lord your God.
003	LEV	019	026	You shall not eat with blood. You shall not practice divination, nor the observation of dreams.
003	LEV	019	027	And you shall not cut the hair of your head circularly, nor shave your beard.
003	LEV	019	028	You shall not cut your flesh for the dead, and you shall not make other figures or marks on yourself. I am the Lord.
003	LEV	019	029	Do not prostitute your daughter, lest the land be contaminated and filled with crimes.
003	LEV	019	030	Observe my Sabbaths, and be apprehensive toward my Sanctuary. I am the Lord.
003	LEV	019	031	Do not turn aside to astrologers, nor consult with soothsayers, so as to be polluted through them. I am the Lord your God.
003	LEV	019	032	Rise up in the presence of a gray-haired head, and honor the reputation of an elder, and fear the Lord your God. I am the Lord.
003	LEV	019	033	If a newcomer lives in your land and abides among you, do not reproach him,
003	LEV	019	034	but let him be among you like one native born. And you shall love him as yourselves. For you were also newcomers in the land of Egypt. I am the Lord your God.
003	LEV	019	035	Do not be willing to accomplish iniquity in judgment, in lengths, in weights, in quantities.
003	LEV	019	036	Let the scales be just and the weights equal, let the dry measure be just and the liquid measure be equal. I am the Lord your God, who led you away from the land of Egypt.
