003	LEV	027	033	It shall not be chosen by what is good or bad; neither shall it be exchanged for another. If anyone has exchanged it, both that which was exchanged, and that for which it was exchanged, shall be sanctified to the Lord and shall not be redeemed.
003	LEV	027	034	These are the precepts, which the Lord commanded Moses for the sons of Israel on mount Sinai.
