004	NUM	005	011	And the Lord spoke to Moses, saying:
004	NUM	005	012	“Speak to the sons of Israel, and you shall say to them: The man whose wife will have gone astray, and, disdaining her husband,
004	NUM	005	013	will have slept with another man, and if her husband cannot discover it, but the adultery is secret, and if it cannot be proved by witnesses, because she was not caught in the shameful act,
004	NUM	005	014	if the spirit of jealousy stirs up the husband against his wife, who either has been polluted or is being assailed with a false suspicion,
004	NUM	005	015	he shall bring her to the priest, and he shall offer an oblation for her, a tenth part of native barley meal. He shall not pour oil over it, nor shall he place frankincense on it, because it is a sacrifice for jealousy, or an oblation investigating adultery.
004	NUM	005	016	Therefore, the priest shall offer it, and he shall set it in the sight of the Lord.
004	NUM	005	017	And he shall take up holy water in an earthen vessel, and he shall cast a little earth from the pavement of the tabernacle into it.
