004	NUM	027	014	For you offended me in the desert of Sin at the Contradiction of the multitude; neither were you willing to sanctify me in their sight over the waters. These are the Waters of Contradiction at Kadesh in the desert of Sin.”
004	NUM	027	015	Moses answered him:
004	NUM	027	016	“May the Lord, the God of the spirits of all flesh, provide a man, who may be over this multitude,
004	NUM	027	017	and who may be able to exit and enter before them, and who may lead them out or lead them in: lest the people of the Lord be like sheep without a shepherd.”
