004	NUM	028	019	And you shall offer the incense of a holocaust to the Lord, two calves from the herd, one ram, seven immaculate one-year-old lambs;
004	NUM	028	020	and with each sacrifice, from fine wheat flour which has been sprinkled with oil, three tenths for each calf, and two tenths for each ram,
004	NUM	028	021	and one tenth for each lamb, that is, for the seven lambs;
004	NUM	028	022	and one he-goat for sin, as an expiation for you,
004	NUM	028	023	aside from the morning holocaust, which you shall always offer.
