004	NUM	028	028	and also, as their sacrifices, fine wheat flour sprinkled with oil, three tenths for each calf, two for each ram,
004	NUM	028	029	one tenth for each lamb, which all together are seven lambs; likewise, a he-goat,
004	NUM	028	030	which is slain for expiation, aside from the perpetual holocaust and its libations.
