004	NUM	031	013	Then Moses, and Eleazar the priest, and all the leaders of the assembly went out to meet them beyond the camp.
004	NUM	031	014	And Moses, being angry with the leaders of the army, and the tribunes, and the centurions, who had arrived from the battle,
004	NUM	031	015	said: “Why have you spared the females?
