005	DEU	002	027	‘We will cross through your land. We will advance by the public way. We will not turn aside, neither to the right, nor to the left.
005	DEU	002	028	Sell us food for a price, so that we may eat. Provide us with water for money, and so we will drink. We only ask that you allow us to pass through,
