005	DEU	009	001	“Listen, O Israel: You shall cross over the Jordan today, in order to possess nations, very great and stronger than yourself, cities vast and walled even to the sky,
005	DEU	009	002	a people great and lofty, the sons of the Anakim, whom you yourselves have seen and heard, against whom no one is able to stand.
