005	DEU	014	022	Each year, you shall separate the tithes out of all your crops which spring forth from the earth.
005	DEU	014	023	And you shall eat these in the sight of the Lord your God, in the place which he will choose, so that his name may be invoked there: the tenth part of your grain and wine and oil, and the firstborn from the herds and your sheep. So may you learn to fear the Lord your God at all times.
005	DEU	014	024	But when the way and the place which the Lord your God will have chosen is further away, and he will have blessed you, so that you are not able to carry all these things to it,
005	DEU	014	025	you shall sell them all, so as to turn them into money, and you shall carry it in your hand, and you shall set out for the place which the Lord will choose.
005	DEU	014	026	And you shall buy with the same money whatever pleases you, either from the herds or from the sheep, and also wine and liquor, and all that your soul desires. And you shall eat in the sight of the Lord your God, and you shall feast: you and your household.
005	DEU	014	027	As for the Levite, who is within your gates, take care that you do not abandon him, for he has no other portion within your possession.
