005	DEU	018	016	just as you petitioned of the Lord your God at Horeb, when the assembly was gathered together, and you said: ‘Let me no longer hear the voice of the Lord my God, and let me no longer see this very great fire, lest I die.’
005	DEU	018	017	And the Lord said to me: ‘They have spoken all these things well.
