005	DEU	019	014	You shall not take up or move the landmark of your neighbor, which those before you have placed, in your possession that the Lord your God will give to you, in the land you will receive to possess.
005	DEU	019	015	One witness shall not stand against another, no matter what the sin or outrage may be. For every word shall stand by the mouth of two or three witnesses.
005	DEU	019	016	If a lying witness will have stood against a man, accusing him of a transgression,
