005	DEU	020	017	Instead, you shall put them to death with the edge of the sword, specifically: the Hittite and the Amorite and the Canaanite, the Perizzite and the Hivite and the Jebusite, just as the Lord your God has commanded you.
005	DEU	020	018	Otherwise, they may teach you to do all the abominations which they have committed for their own gods. And then you would sin against the Lord your God.
