010	2SA	001	001	Now it happened that, after Saul died, David returned from the slaughter of Amalek, and he remained for two days at Ziklag.
010	2SA	001	002	Then, on the third day, a man appeared, arriving from the camp of Saul, with his garments torn and dust sprinkled on his head. And when he came to David, he fell on his face, and he reverenced.
