011	1KI	021	013	And bringing forward two men, sons of the devil, they caused them to sit opposite him. And they, acting indeed like diabolical men, spoke testimony against him before the multitude: “Naboth has blasphemed God and king.” For this reason, they led him away, beyond the city, and they put him to death by stoning.
011	1KI	021	014	And they sent to Jezebel, saying, “Naboth has been stoned, and he has died.”
