013	1CH	007	025	And Rephah was his son, and Resheph, and Telah, from whom was born Tahan,
013	1CH	007	026	who conceived Ladan. And his son was Ammihud, who conceived Elishama,
013	1CH	007	027	from whom was born Nun, who had Joshua as a son.
013	1CH	007	028	Now their possessions and habitations were: Bethel with her daughters, and toward the east, Naaran, and toward the western region, Gezer and her daughters, as well as Shechem with her daughters, as far as Ayyah with her daughters;
