013	1CH	026	003	Elam the fifth, Jehohanan the sixth, Eliehoenai the seventh.
013	1CH	026	004	Then the sons of Obededom: Shemaiah the firstborn, Jehozabad the second, Joah the third, Sachar the fourth, Nethanel the fifth,
013	1CH	026	005	Ammiel the sixth, Issachar the seventh, Peullethai the eighth. For the Lord had blessed him.
