013	1CH	027	018	over Judah, Elihu, the brother of David; over Issachar, Omri, the son of Michael;
013	1CH	027	019	over the Zebulunites, Ishmaiah, the son of Obadiah; over the Naphtalites, Jeremoth, the son of Azriel;
013	1CH	027	020	over the sons of Ephraim, Hoshea, the son of Azaziah; over the one half tribe of Manasseh, Joel, the son of Pedaiah;
