015	EZR	008	007	From the sons of Elam, Jeshaiah, the son of Athaliah, and seventy men were with him.
015	EZR	008	008	From the sons of Shephatiah, Zebadiah, the son of Michael, and eighty men were with him.
015	EZR	008	009	From the sons of Joab, Obadiah, the son of Jehiel, and two hundred eighteen men were with him.
