018	JOB	033	007	So, truly, do not let my wonders terrify you, and do not let my eloquence be burdensome to you.
018	JOB	033	008	For you have spoken in my hearing, and I have heard the voice of your words, saying:
018	JOB	033	009	“I am clean and without sin; I am immaculate, and there is no iniquity in me.
