023	ISA	003	010	Tell the just man that it is well, for he shall eat from the fruit from his own plans.
023	ISA	003	011	Woe to the impious man immersed in evil! For retribution will be given to him from his own hands.
023	ISA	003	012	As for my people, their oppressors have despoiled them, and women have ruled over them. My people, who call you blessed, the same are deceiving you and disrupting the path of your steps.
023	ISA	003	013	The Lord stands for judgment, and he stands to judge the people.
023	ISA	003	014	The Lord will enter into judgment with the elders of his people, and with their leaders. For you have been devouring the vineyard, and the plunder from the poor is in your house.
023	ISA	003	015	Why do you wear down my people, and grind up the faces of the poor, says the Lord, the God of hosts?
