023	ISA	007	004	And you shall say to him: “See to it that you are silent. Do not be afraid. And have no dread in your heart over the two tails of these firebrands, nearly extinguished, which are the wrath of the fury of Rezin, king of Syria, and of the son of Remaliah.”
023	ISA	007	005	For Syria has undertaken a plan against you, with the evil of Ephraim and the son of Remaliah, saying:
