023	ISA	009	021	After all this, his fury was not turned away; instead, his hand was still extended.
023	ISA	010	001	Woe to those who make unfair laws, and who, when writing, write injustice:
023	ISA	010	002	in order to oppress the poor in judgment, and to do violence to the case of the humble of my people, in order that widows may be their prey, and that they might plunder the orphan.
