023	ISA	025	003	Concerning this, a strong people will praise you; a city with a robust people will fear you.
023	ISA	025	004	For you have been the strength of the poor, the strength of the indigent in his tribulation, a refuge from the whirlwind, a shadow from the heat. For the spirit of the mighty is like a whirlwind striking against a wall.
