023	ISA	057	006	Your portion is in the currents of the torrent; this is your lot! And you yourselves have poured out libations to them; you have offered sacrifice. Should I not be angry over these things?
023	ISA	057	007	Upon a high and lofty mountain, you have placed your bed, and you have ascended to that place to immolate victims.
023	ISA	057	008	And behind the door, and beyond the post, you have set up your memorial. For you uncovered yourself next to me, and you received an adulterer. You widened your bed, and you formed a pact with them. You loved their bed with an open hand.
