024	JER	003	008	that because the apostate Israel had committed adultery, I had dismissed her and had given her a bill of divorce. Yet her deceitful sister Judah was not afraid. But she, too, went and committed fornication herself.
024	JER	003	009	And by the act of her fornication, she defiled the land. For she committed adultery with that which is stone and wood.
024	JER	003	010	And after all these things, her deceitful sister Judah has not returned to me with her whole heart, but with lies, says the Lord.”
024	JER	003	011	And the Lord said to me: “The apostate Israel has justified her own soul by comparing herself to the deceitful Judah.
