027	DAN	001	010	And the leader of the eunuchs said to Daniel, “I am afraid of my lord the king, who has appointed food and drink for you, who, if he should see that your faces are leaner than those of the other youths your age, you would condemn my head to the king.”
027	DAN	001	011	And Daniel said to Malasar, whom the leader of the eunuchs had appointed over Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael, and Azariah,
027	DAN	001	012	“I beg you to test us, your servants, for ten days, and let roots be given to us to eat and water to drink,
027	DAN	001	013	and then observe our faces, and the faces of the children who eat the king’s food, and then deal with your servants according to what you see.”
027	DAN	001	014	When he had heard these words, he tested them for ten days.
027	DAN	001	015	But, after ten days, their faces appeared better and fatter than all the children who had eaten from the king’s food.
027	DAN	001	016	Thereafter, Malasar took away their portions and their wine for drinking, and he gave them roots.
