027	DAN	002	017	And he went into his house and explained the task to Hananiah, and Mishael, and Azariah, his companions,
027	DAN	002	018	so that they would seek mercy before the face of the God of heaven, about this mystery, and so that Daniel and his companions might not perish with the other wise men of Babylon.
