# BOOK	029	JOE	Joel	Joel
029	JOE	001	001	The word of the Lord that came to Joel, the son of Pethuel.
029	JOE	001	002	Listen to this, elders, and pay close attention, all inhabitants of the land. Did this ever happen in your days or in the days of your fathers?
029	JOE	001	003	Talk this over with your sons, and your sons with their sons, and their sons with another generation.
029	JOE	001	004	The locust has eaten what the caterpillar has left, and the beetle has eaten what the locust has left, and the mildew has eaten what the beetle has left.
029	JOE	001	005	Rouse yourselves, you drunkards, and weep and wail, all you who delight in drinking wine; for it has been cut off from your mouth.
029	JOE	001	006	For a nation has ascended over my land: strong and without number. His teeth are like the teeth of a lion, and his molars are like that of a lion’s young.
029	JOE	001	007	He has put my vineyard into desolation, and he has pulled off the bark of my fig tree. He has stripped it bare and cast it away; its branches have become white.
029	JOE	001	008	Lament like a betrothed virgin, wrapped in sackcloth at the loss of the husband of her youth.
029	JOE	001	009	Sacrifice and libation have perished from the house of the Lord; the priests who are ministers of the Lord have mourned.
029	JOE	001	010	The region has been depopulated, the soil has mourned. For the wheat has been devastated, the wine has been disfigured, the oil has languished.
029	JOE	001	011	The farmers have been confounded, the vineyard workers have wailed over the crop and the barley, because the harvest of the field has perished.
029	JOE	001	012	The vineyard is in ruin, and the fig tree has languished. The pomegranate tree, and the palm tree, and the fruit tree, and all the trees of the field have withered. For joy has been thrown into disorder before the sons of men.
029	JOE	001	013	Priests, gird yourselves and lament. Ministers of the altars, wail. Enter, ministers of my God, lie in sackcloth. For sacrifice and libation have passed away from the house of your God.
029	JOE	001	014	Sanctify a fast, call an assembly, gather the elders and all the inhabitants of the land into the house of your God. And cry out to the Lord:
029	JOE	001	015	“Ah, ah, ah, the day!” For the day of the Lord is near, and it will arrive, like a devastation, before the powerful.
