030	AMO	005	027	And I will cause you to go into captivity across Damascus, says the Lord. The God of hosts is his name.
030	AMO	006	001	Woe to you who have been wealthy in Zion, and to you who have confidence in the mountain of Samaria: aristocrats, heads of the people, who advance with a retinue into the house of Israel.
030	AMO	006	002	Cross over to Calneh and see, and go from there into Hamath the great, and descend into Gath of the Philistines, and to the best kingdoms of these, if their limits are wider than your limits.
030	AMO	006	003	You have been set aside for the day of disaster, and you approach the throne of iniquity.
030	AMO	006	004	You sleep on beds of ivory, and you are lustful on your couches. You devour lambs from the flock and calves from the midst of the herd.
030	AMO	006	005	You sing to the sound of stringed instruments; they consider themselves to have the musical abilities of David.
030	AMO	006	006	You drink wine in bowls, and you anoint with the best ointments; and they suffer nothing over the grief of Joseph.
030	AMO	006	007	Because of this, now they will depart at the head of those who go into captivity; and the faction of the lustful will be removed.
