030	AMO	007	004	These things the Lord God has revealed to me. And behold, the Lord God called for judgment unto fire, and it devoured the manifold abyss, and it consumed simultaneously in every direction.
030	AMO	007	005	And I said, “Lord God, cease, I beg you. Who will raise up Jacob, for he is little?”
