030	AMO	008	001	These things the Lord has revealed to me. And behold, a hook to draw down fruit.
030	AMO	008	002	And he said, “What do you see, Amos?” And I said, “A hook to draw down fruit.” And the Lord said to me, “The end has come for my people Israel. I will no longer pass through them.”
030	AMO	008	003	And the hinges of the temple will creak in that day, says the Lord God. Many will die. Silence will be thrown away in all places.
