# BOOK	040	MAT	Matthew	Matthew
040	MAT	001	001	The book of the lineage of Jesus Christ, the son of David, the son of Abraham.
040	MAT	001	002	Abraham conceived Isaac. And Isaac conceived Jacob. And Jacob conceived Judah and his brothers.
040	MAT	001	003	And Judah conceived Perez and Zerah by Tamar. And Perez conceived Hezron. And Hezron conceived Ram.
040	MAT	001	004	And Ram conceived Amminadab. And Amminadab conceived Nahshon. And Nahshon conceived Salmon.
040	MAT	001	005	And Salmon conceived Boaz by Rahab. And Boaz conceived Obed by Ruth. And Obed conceived Jesse.
040	MAT	001	006	And Jesse conceived king David. And king David conceived Solomon, by her who had been the wife of Uriah.
040	MAT	001	007	And Solomon conceived Rehoboam. And Rehoboam conceived Abijah. And Abijah conceived Asa.
040	MAT	001	008	And Asa conceived Jehoshaphat. And Jehoshaphat conceived Joram. And Joram conceived Uzziah.
040	MAT	001	009	And Uzziah conceived Jotham. And Jotham conceived Ahaz. And Ahaz conceived Hezekiah.
040	MAT	001	010	And Hezekiah conceived Manasseh. And Manasseh conceived Amos. And Amos conceived Josiah.
040	MAT	001	011	And Josiah conceived Jechoniah and his brothers in the transmigration of Babylon.
040	MAT	001	012	And after the transmigration of Babylon, Jechoniah conceived Shealtiel. And Shealtiel conceived Zerubbabel.
040	MAT	001	013	And Zerubbabel conceived Abiud. And Abiud conceived Eliakim. And Eliakim conceived Azor.
040	MAT	001	014	And Azor conceived Zadok. And Zadok conceived Achim. And Achim conceived Eliud.
040	MAT	001	015	And Eliud conceived Eleazar. And Eleazar conceived Matthan. And Matthan conceived Jacob.
040	MAT	001	016	And Jacob conceived Joseph, the husband of Mary, of whom was born Jesus, who is called Christ.
