040	MAT	024	041	Two women will be grinding at a millstone: one will be taken up, and one will be left behind.
040	MAT	024	042	Therefore, be vigilant. For you do not know at what hour your Lord will return.
040	MAT	024	043	But know this: if only the father of the family knew at what hour the thief would arrive, he would certainly keep vigil and not permit his house to be broken into.
