040	MAT	025	045	Then he shall respond to them by saying: ‘Amen I say to you, whenever you did not do it to one of these least, neither did you do it to me.’
040	MAT	025	046	And these shall go into eternal punishment, but the just shall go into eternal life.”
040	MAT	026	001	And it happened that, when Jesus had completed all these words, he said to his disciples,
040	MAT	026	002	“You know that after two days the Passover will begin, and the Son of man will be handed over to be crucified.”
