040	MAT	026	007	a woman drew near to him, holding an alabaster box of precious ointment, and she poured it over his head while he was reclining at table.
040	MAT	026	008	But the disciples, seeing this, were indignant, saying: “What is the purpose of this waste?
040	MAT	026	009	For this could have been sold for a great deal, so as to be given to the poor.”
