041	MAR	001	001	The beginning of the Gospel of Jesus Christ, the Son of God.
041	MAR	001	002	As it has been written by the prophet Isaiah: “Behold, I send my Angel before your face, who shall prepare your way before you.
041	MAR	001	003	The voice of one crying out in the desert: Prepare the way of the Lord; make straight his paths.”
