041	MAR	015	033	And when the sixth hour arrived, a darkness occurred over the entire earth, until the ninth hour.
041	MAR	015	034	And at the ninth hour, Jesus cried out with a loud voice, saying, “Eloi, Eloi, lamma sabacthani?” which means, “My God, My God, why have you forsaken me?”
