044	ACT	001	022	beginning from the baptism of John, until the day when he was taken up from us, one of these be made a witness with us of his Resurrection.”
044	ACT	001	023	And they appointed two: Joseph, who was called Barsabbas, who was surnamed Justus, and Matthias.
044	ACT	001	024	And praying, they said: “May you, O Lord, who knows the heart of everyone, reveal which one of these two you have chosen,
044	ACT	001	025	to take a place in this ministry and apostleship, from which Judas prevaricated, so that he might go to his own place.”
