044	ACT	002	001	And when the days of Pentecost were completed, they were all together in the same place.
044	ACT	002	002	And suddenly, there came a sound from heaven, like that of a wind approaching violently, and it filled the entire house where they were sitting.
044	ACT	002	003	And there appeared to them separate tongues, as if of fire, which settled upon each one of them.
044	ACT	002	004	And they were all filled with the Holy Spirit. And they began to speak in various languages, just as the Holy Spirit bestowed eloquence to them.
