044	ACT	002	010	Phrygia and Pamphylia, Egypt and the parts of Libya which are around Cyrene, and new arrivals of the Romans,
044	ACT	002	011	likewise Jews and new converts, Cretans and Arabs: we have heard them speaking in our own languages the mighty deeds of God.”
044	ACT	002	012	And they were all astonished, and they wondered, saying to one another: “But what does this mean?”
