044	ACT	002	023	This man, under the definitive plan and foreknowledge of God, was delivered by the hands of the unjust, afflicted, and put to death.
044	ACT	002	024	And he whom God has raised up has broken the sorrows of Hell, for certainly it was impossible for him to be held by it.
