044	ACT	002	037	Now when they had heard these things, they were contrite in heart, and they said to Peter and to the other Apostles: “What should we do, noble brothers?”
044	ACT	002	038	Yet truly, Peter said to them: “Do penance; and be baptized, each one of you, in the name of Jesus Christ, for the remission of your sins. And you shall receive the gift of the Holy Spirit.
044	ACT	002	039	For the Promise is for you and for your sons, and for all who are far away: for whomever the Lord our God will have called.”
044	ACT	002	040	And then, with very many other words, he testified and he exhorted them, saying, “Save yourselves from this depraved generation.”
044	ACT	002	041	Therefore, those who accepted his discourse were baptized. And about three thousand souls were added on that day.
