044	ACT	028	017	And after the third day, he called together the leaders of the Jews. And when they had convened, he said to them: “Noble brothers, I have done nothing against the people, nor against the customs of the fathers, yet I was delivered as a prisoner from Jerusalem into the hands of the Romans.
044	ACT	028	018	And after they held a hearing about me, they would have released me, because there was no case for death against me.
