045	ROM	003	012	All have gone astray; together they have become useless. There is no one who does good; there is not even one.
045	ROM	003	013	Their throat is an open sepulcher. With their tongues, they have been acting deceitfully. The venom of asps is under their lips.
045	ROM	003	014	Their mouth is full of curses and bitterness.
045	ROM	003	015	Their feet are swift to shed blood.
045	ROM	003	016	Grief and unhappiness are in their ways.
045	ROM	003	017	And the way of peace they have not known.
045	ROM	003	018	There is no fear of God before their eyes.”
045	ROM	003	019	But we know that whatever the law speaks, it speaks to those who are in the law, so that every mouth may be silenced and the entire world may be subject to God.
045	ROM	003	020	For in his presence no flesh shall be justified by the works of the law. For knowledge of sin is through the law.
045	ROM	003	021	But now, without the law, the justice of God, to which the law and the prophets have testified, has been made manifest.
045	ROM	003	022	And the justice of God, through the faith of Jesus Christ, is in all those and over all those who believe in him. For there is no distinction.
045	ROM	003	023	For all have sinned and all are in need of the glory of God.
